## Verification Checklist

1. [ ] Compare output values at specific timestamps (enable debug_times)
2. [ ] Verify line visibility matches (alternating vs simultaneous)
3. [ ] Check signal positions match (markers at correct price levels)
4. [ ] Export CSV and compare with TradingView data export
5. [ ] Visual comparison of charts

## Known backtrader Limitations

1. **No text labels**: Use markers (^, v, o, s, etc.) instead of plotshape text
2. **No fill between lines**: Limited support compared to Pine Script's fill()
3. **No style.linebr**: Lines are continuous; use NaN to create breaks
